        "description": "Stellar Jubilee: Dance of Aurore — a party member's Superconduct or Cryo Swirl becomes a Stellar-Conduct or Stellar Swirl reaction instead, and that reaction's BASE DMG is increased by 0.7% per 100 of ODETTE's ATK, capped at +14% (reached at 2,000 ATK). This is the SELF-scope half, offered only when Odette is the scored character: her ATK is then the build's own ATK, so the stellarglimmer_basedmg_from_atk_ / _cap_ conversion pair reads it live (post-buff) per build and caps itself. Applied to stellarglimmer_basedmg_, a base-DMG multiplier rather than a DMG% bonus, and the umbrella key since the kit converts into EITHER Stellar reaction. When Odette is a teammate the builder offers passive3StellarJubileeSourceAtk instead, which takes her ATK as a typed input.",
